1
00:00:00,536 --> 00:00:04,164
When government AI can act, who verifies its authority?

2
00:00:05,921 --> 00:00:08,380
WAKALA verifies each agent's identity,

3
00:00:08,380 --> 00:00:12,779
and limits every delegated action to the citizen's specific request.

4
00:00:14,752 --> 00:00:17,298
In a separate, deliberately triggered test,

5
00:00:17,298 --> 00:00:20,496
the Insurance Agent asks for another citizen's record.

6
00:00:20,746 --> 00:00:23,948
WAKALA blocks it before any protected data is returned.

7
00:00:25,800 --> 00:00:30,779
Behaviour Watch raises an incident. A verified officer contains it,

8
00:00:30,779 --> 00:00:33,900
and reassigns the task to a standby agent.

9
00:00:35,890 --> 00:00:40,247
The legitimate service continues, unrelated citizens are unaffected,

10
00:00:40,247 --> 00:00:42,810
and every completed action is traceable.

11
00:00:44,350 --> 00:00:46,892
Attack Lab runs eight attack scenarios.

12
00:00:46,892 --> 00:00:50,608
Document Shield quarantines hidden document instructions.

13
00:00:51,350 --> 00:00:56,705
Synthetic benchmarks measure enforcement. Shadow Mode tests policies safely.
